# 🚀 Quick Start

Get up and running in just a few minutes.

---

# 👤 1. Create Your Account

1. Visit the website.
2. Click **Sign Up**.
3. Enter your **Email** and **Password**.
4. Click **Log In**.

> 💡 **Tip:** "Remember Me" keeps your session available for one-click login while maintaining account security.

---

# 🔄 2. Enable Automatic MT4/MT5 Trade Sync

Automatically import every closed trade directly from MetaTrader.

## Step 1 — Generate Your Sync Key

Navigate to:

```
Settings
   └── MT4/MT5 Sync (EA)
```

Click **Generate** and copy your unique **Sync Key**.

---

## Step 2 — Configure MetaTrader Terminal

Open:

```
Tools
   └── Options
          └── Expert Advisors
```

Enable:

✅ Allow WebRequest for listed URL

Add:

```text
https://jlcgfogamjjgsieatuxi.supabase.co
```

---

## Step 3 — Attach the EA

Attach:

```
nXuu_TradeSync
```

to **any chart**.

Fill in the EA Inputs:

| Setting | Value |
|----------|-------|
| SyncKey | Your generated Sync Key |
| AccountLabel *(Optional)* | FTMO / Personal / Demo / etc. |

Click **OK**.

---

## ✅ Done!

Every time MT4/MT5 starts with the EA attached:

- ✔ Automatically uploads all closed trades
- ✔ Syncs new trades only
- ✔ Never creates duplicate trades
- ✔ Works silently in the background

> 🔐 If you regenerate or revoke your Sync Key, remember to update it inside the EA settings. Previous keys become invalid immediately.

